Package: glmnetUI
Title: Interactive 'shiny' Interface for Elastic Net Modeling with 'glmnet'
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("William", "Craytor", , "bcraytor@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A self-contained 'shiny' application for interactive elastic net
    regression modeling using 'glmnet'. Provides point-and-click variable
    selection, alpha/lambda tuning with cross-validation, coefficient sign
    warnings for model defensibility, diagnostic plots via 'ggplot2', and
    formatted report export via 'Quarto' or 'rmarkdown'. Designed for real
    estate appraisers and general regression users who need an accessible
    interface for regularized regression. Methods are described in
    Friedman, Hastie, and Tibshirani (2010) <doi:10.18637/jss.v033.i01>
    and Zou and Hastie (2005) <doi:10.1111/j.1467-9868.2005.00503.x>.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/wcraytor/glmnetUI
BugReports: https://github.com/wcraytor/glmnetUI/issues
